---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Club Dadvice — Case Study" description="Where dads level up to raise world-class kids">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Work</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <span class="tenet">Clarity</span>
      <span class="tenet">AI</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Club Dadvice</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">Where dads level up to raise world-class kids</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>
        Parenting content is everywhere. But most of it's written for mums, by mums. 
        Dads searching for help find themselves wading through content that doesn't 
        speak to them or address their specific challenges.
      </p>
      <p>
        There's no shortage of parenting podcasts, but who has time? And when you do 
        find something useful, how do you remember it at 3am when your toddler is 
        having a meltdown?
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Approach</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <h3>1. For Dads, By Design</h3>
      <p>Every piece of content is framed for fathers. Not patronising "dad hacks" — real, actionable parenting wisdom presented in a way that resonates with how dads think.</p>
      
      <h3>2. Podcast-to-Article Pipeline</h3>
      <p>The best parenting podcasts get transcribed, summarised, and transformed into quick-reference articles. Find what you need in minutes, not hours.</p>
      
      <h3>3. Searchable Wisdom</h3>
      <p>Filter by challenge: tantrums, teenagers, bedtime battles, sibling wars. Find relevant advice exactly when you need it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Build</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AI transcription</strong> — Parenting podcasts processed automatically</li>
        <li><strong>Smart summarisation</strong> — Key insights extracted with dad-friendly framing</li>
        <li><strong>Category taxonomy</strong> — Content organised by age, challenge, situation</li>
        <li><strong>Mobile-first</strong> — Because you're reading this at 2am on your phone</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Sample Content</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul>
        <li>"The three real reasons your kid isn't doing what you asked"</li>
        <li>"The dad's ultimate role: be the captain of the ship"</li>
        <li>"You can't stop the feeling, but you can steer the ship"</li>
        <li>"When your daughter's sass turns scary: a dad's guide"</li>
        <li>"The Brothers' Hug: a genius hack for ending sibling squabbles"</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Outcome</h2>
    <div class="case-outcome">
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">100+</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">articles curated</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">Live</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">in production</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="outcome-text">A growing resource for dads who want practical, no-nonsense parenting guidance that meets them where they are.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Visit</h2>
    <div class="demo-box">
      <a href="https://dadvice.club/" target="_blank" class="cta-button">dadvice.club ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Content</h2>
    <div class="related-items">
      <a href="/case-studies/investing-dojo" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">📊</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Investing Dojo</strong>
          <span>Same AI pipeline, different audience</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/clarity" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">→</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Clarity Tenet</strong>
          <span>Making complex things simple</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Got an audience that needs reaching?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .case-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-outcome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .outcome-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .outcome-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .demo-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .related-section {
    border-top: none;
  }
  
  .related-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .related-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .related-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-link strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .related-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
